  "plain": "In 2025, people from the Disclosure Project, a campaign run by the UFO activist Steven Greer to get insiders to testify in public, reached out to a former sergeant named Dan Sherman and offered him immunity as a whistleblower if he would testify. Sherman, who says the NSA once hired him to communicate with aliens, tells Michels about the contact himself, saying it came from \"not Steven Greer himself, but somebody else now,\" and that he and Greer \"talked a long time ago.\""
